      why:
        question: "Bu kopyada ne yanl\u0131\u015F gitmi\u015F?"
        options:
        - "Metan\u0131n form\xFCl\xFC yanl\u0131\u015F yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015F."
        - "Suyun ve oksijenin katsay\u0131s\u0131 unutulmu\u015F."
        - Karbon fazla, bir karbon silinmeli.
        correctIndex: 1
        replies:
        - "Form\xFCle dokunulmaz: CH\u2084 hep CH\u2084't\xFCr. De\u011Fi\u015Fen
          yaln\u0131zca \xF6n\xFCndeki say\u0131, katsay\u0131."
        - "Aynen \xF6yle. 2 H\u2082O ve 2 O\u2082 yaz\u0131l\u0131nca H 4/4, O 4/4
          olur."
        - "Karbon zaten iki tarafta birer tane. Atom silinmez; katsay\u0131yla say\u0131lar
          e\u015Fitlenir."
    - reactants:
      - species: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2bcd2662ada36e448b01974ed7f2bbe4, type: 2}
        amount: 1
      - species: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3372ae1a20c7b040be0a7644035caaf, type: 2}
        amount: 5
      products:
      - species: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 50ddecd6f6537fd48aa42ccc142f47e6, type: 2}
        amount: 1
      - species: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d7d1e9c4ee5640419e910786ab51966, type: 2}
        amount: 4
      why:
        question: "Bu denklemi nas\u0131l d\xFCzeltirsin?"
        options:
        - "CO\u2082'nin \xF6n\xFCne 3 yazar\u0131m; karbonla birlikte oksijen de
          10 olur."
        - "C\u2083H\u2088'i CH\u2088 yapar\u0131m, karbon tek kal\u0131r."
        - "O\u2082'nin katsay\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r\u0131m."
        correctIndex: 0
        replies:
        - "Do\u011Fru. 3 CO\u2082 \u2192 C 3/3; O 6 + 4 = 10, soldaki 5 O\u2082 ile
          e\u015Fit."
        - "Form\xFCl de\u011Fi\u015Firse madde de\u011Fi\u015Fir: o art\u0131k propan
          olmaz. Katsay\u0131yla d\xFCzeltilir."
        - "Solda oksijen zaten fazla (10'a 6). Eksik olan sa\u011Fda: karbonla ba\u015Fla."
